{
  "schema": "indy-init.r10-contract-first-ui.merge-dependencies/1",
  "description": "PROPOSED (ODR-COMP-P16): the competition's merge-time needs of each governed journey assertion, for slice-gate --assertion-needs (Ledger.deferredAssertions, CF-07). Derived mechanically by tools/r10/assertion-merge-needs.fsx from docs/rehearsal-010-readiness/assertion-merge-needs.json (ODR-R10-33 A, PR #121's rules): every rule keeps its assertions and reason; each needed slice is moved to the competition slice (docs/competition-readiness/slice-execution-manifest.json) that owns the requirements it stands for, and the needs are de-duplicated. Rehearsal 010's file names 11 slices the competition plan does not have; the gate ignores an absent id, so with that file the competition would judge those assertions before what they need is on main.",
  "derivedFrom": {
    "rehearsal010Needs": {
